2026-06-24 10:59:11.676 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:258 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: The old theater held a quiet sophistication, and every rehearsal felt like a step toward perfection.  
Maya wore a simple disguise, yet her voice gave the whole entity onstage surprising depth.  
She did not aspire to fame alone; she wanted a perfect solution to a broken story.  
During each rehearsal, she adjusted the disguise and chased a solution that felt both bold and elegant.  
